WEBVTT

00:14.630 --> 00:19.600
The sweet whispers of love only happen twice.

00:20.880 --> 00:25.970
Before you know it, you're taken prisoner. Chocolat à la folie.

00:27.440 --> 00:32.390
The stardust of dawn is inlaid in the sky.

00:33.850 --> 00:38.820
My emerald eyes have you in their sights!

00:40.250 --> 00:45.000
Sugar Sugar Rune! Choco Choco Rune!

00:46.640 --> 00:51.470
The sparkling hearts are secret jewels.

00:52.930 --> 00:58.220
Even if the boys bully you,

00:59.400 --> 01:04.400
They've just fallen in love. Chocolat à la folie.

01:05.890 --> 01:10.860
They're really in love with you. Chocolat à la folie.

01:23.350 --> 01:25.200
Chocolat à la folie.

02:13.720 --> 02:16.690
A sweet kiss of chocolate on your lips.

02:16.690 --> 02:18.530
Cut!

02:20.560 --> 02:21.730
That isn't going to work...

02:22.160 --> 02:23.480
The theme of this commercial

02:23.480 --> 02:28.270
is to express a different side compared to the usual Rockin' Robin-san.

02:28.600 --> 02:30.470
Huh? Robin-san...

02:32.170 --> 02:36.780
Your excited gaze has gotten
me all pumped up, baby.

02:36.780 --> 02:38.240
Robin-sama!

02:40.380 --> 02:42.610
Extase tentation!

02:42.610 --> 02:44.810
Give your heart to me!

02:46.850 --> 02:48.050
Thanks.

02:48.550 --> 02:51.460
Huh? What was I...

02:51.460 --> 02:53.490
Vanilla, did you see that?

02:53.490 --> 02:57.430
Yeah, he collected a pink
heart just like that.

02:57.760 --> 03:00.800
Let me write this down..
"Your excited gaze has..."

03:02.470 --> 03:04.870
I have a feeling this is not
the first time we've met.

03:05.470 --> 03:09.120
Perhaps we were lovers in a past life.

03:09.370 --> 03:11.380
Robin-sama!

03:12.610 --> 03:14.480
Thank you, come again.

03:14.480 --> 03:16.780
Huh?! Another heart?

03:16.780 --> 03:23.180
Wow! Um... "I feel like we've already
met. Lovers from a past life..."

03:23.820 --> 03:27.090
I hate to admit it, but
Robin really is amazing.

03:27.490 --> 03:32.630
But if I use Robin's techniques,
maybe I can get tons of hearts!

03:35.470 --> 03:37.190
And now for the reeesults!

03:39.840 --> 03:42.110
Currently, Vanilla has 30,000 ecure!

03:42.670 --> 03:44.940
Chocolat has 6,500 ecure!

03:44.940 --> 03:46.940
You're the worst in history!

03:49.180 --> 03:53.490
At this rate you might not even make
it as a basic witch, let alone Queen.

03:53.490 --> 03:54.150
I'm so shocked! I hate the Human
World, I'm not popular at all!

03:54.150 --> 03:58.360
I'm so shocked! I hate the Human
World, I'm not popular at all!

03:58.360 --> 03:59.760
Then go back to the Magical World.

04:00.830 --> 04:03.190
You didn't come here to fool around, did you?

04:04.730 --> 04:08.800
Damn you, Robin! One day I'll show you!

04:08.800 --> 04:11.350
But the person you want to show isn't here!

04:12.540 --> 04:15.140
Study Robin! The Great Love Strategy!

04:17.110 --> 04:19.180
We've been secretly following him.. .

04:20.410 --> 04:23.520
And snuck in through the studio's window
where the commercial was shot.

04:23.520 --> 04:24.780
Is that really okay?

04:25.850 --> 04:30.160
It'll be fine. It's not like Robin takes
his job seriously anyway.

04:30.720 --> 04:35.060
Vanilla-chama, don't be
taken in by her words.

04:35.060 --> 04:40.000
Hehe... It'd be pretty sweet if I was the
only one to steal Robin's techniques.

04:40.000 --> 04:42.800
It's the words of the Devil!

04:42.800 --> 04:46.040
I want to study Robin-sensei's
techniques too!

04:48.310 --> 04:49.470
I can feel it...

04:49.470 --> 04:51.210
A stare of burning passion!

04:52.640 --> 04:54.550
Who are you?

04:56.510 --> 04:58.520
Oh? And you are?

05:01.650 --> 05:04.560
If you stare at my like
that, I'll get embarrassed.

05:06.590 --> 05:09.290
Robin-san, we're about to start the shoot.

05:09.290 --> 05:11.600
Ah, sorry.

05:12.760 --> 05:16.430
I have to go back to work now, unfortunately.

05:16.430 --> 05:19.200
And yet, my captured heart
cannot be separated.

05:19.200 --> 05:21.070
Don't go, Robin!

05:21.070 --> 05:21.930
Um.. .

05:21.930 --> 05:24.240
I have lunch!

05:24.240 --> 05:25.880
Oh, it's lunch!

05:25.880 --> 05:30.680
To take a meal or to take love before
they get cold is: Mangiare! Cantare!

05:30.680 --> 05:32.120
Do you really have to go?

05:32.120 --> 05:34.990
Non, non. Please don't make such a sad face.

05:34.990 --> 05:38.120
Look forward to the next time we meet.

05:38.720 --> 05:39.990
I shall return.

05:40.330 --> 05:42.260
These are my true feelings.

05:42.260 --> 05:43.860
Robin!

05:45.360 --> 05:46.300
Merci.

05:48.030 --> 05:50.660
"Catch a heart with a present."

05:53.770 --> 05:55.000
Yes, keep 'em coming.

05:56.370 --> 05:57.440
Robin-sama!

05:57.440 --> 05:59.010
How wonderful!

06:01.950 --> 06:03.720
Is he some kind of genius?

06:03.720 --> 06:05.920
"Blowing kisses is effective."

06:05.920 --> 06:07.950
I can't act like that!

06:09.250 --> 06:11.010
Mmm, delicious.

06:12.720 --> 06:14.060
Buono, buono!

06:14.430 --> 06:17.020
...he says, but it's just a normal lunch.

06:17.700 --> 06:19.120
But Robin-sensei makes

06:19.120 --> 06:22.820
the image of eating like the nectar of flowers or just floating in the air.

06:23.640 --> 06:25.000
Vanilla, take notes.

06:25.000 --> 06:27.040
Huh? Even this?

06:27.040 --> 06:31.180
Yeah, we don't know what
might be helpful, after all.

06:31.180 --> 06:36.410
Um... "Start with the meatballs,
and don't like pickles."

06:36.410 --> 06:39.080
Look! Robin-sama is eating his lunch!

06:39.080 --> 06:40.550
He's so cute!

06:42.420 --> 06:45.060
Robin-sama is sipping his tea!

06:45.060 --> 06:47.060
It looks like it doesn't
matter what he does at all.

06:47.590 --> 06:51.300
Ah! It's getting to see Robin do things they
wouldn't normally think he'd do!

06:51.630 --> 06:55.180
That gap must be what captures girls' hearts!

06:55.630 --> 06:56.670
Huh?

06:58.200 --> 06:59.140
Carrots.

06:59.840 --> 07:02.170
I don't really understand.

07:03.840 --> 07:07.680
Dummy! Dummy! Why am I thinking about Pierre?

07:08.110 --> 07:10.070
"The gap is important."

07:10.280 --> 07:13.280
How he's that popular is a real mystery.

07:13.280 --> 07:17.160
He's actually 6800 years
old, it's suspicious.

07:17.390 --> 07:21.360
Perhaps every night he uses
a beauty mask, it's moving!

07:22.960 --> 07:24.560
What are you guys doing here?

07:25.830 --> 07:29.330
Non, non. I don't understand
the concept of that image.

07:29.330 --> 07:30.940
Maybe something else would be more. . .

07:30.940 --> 07:32.640
Let go of me!

07:33.400 --> 07:36.240
These children have gotten
lost in the studio.

07:36.240 --> 07:37.240
What should we do with them?

07:37.940 --> 07:39.180
Oh, no!

07:42.580 --> 07:44.080
He's gonna get mad at us...

07:44.080 --> 07:48.450
Man, let go of us. Robin knows us.

07:48.450 --> 07:49.650
Chocolat-chan. ..

07:50.020 --> 07:52.690
Hey, don't make up such crazy lies!

07:52.690 --> 07:54.430
Robin, what are you looking at?

07:54.430 --> 07:56.620
Hurry up and save us!
You're our guardian, right?

07:56.990 --> 07:59.160
Could they be Robin-sama's children?

07:59.160 --> 08:00.000
What a shock!

08:00.000 --> 08:00.930
No way!

08:02.000 --> 08:03.900
Don't say that, Mademoiselles.

08:03.900 --> 08:05.420
Telling lies isn't cute.

08:07.110 --> 08:10.110
Non, non! I've never seen
these children before.

08:10.110 --> 08:11.130
What?!

08:11.710 --> 08:14.060
Come back once you've
become wonderful ladies.

08:18.720 --> 08:20.820
This isn't a place to play.

08:20.820 --> 08:22.610
I'm sorry.

08:22.990 --> 08:27.190
Man, Robin said he didn't know us!

08:27.190 --> 08:28.530
I'll whup his butt!

08:28.530 --> 08:31.160
"Above all, promises are preferred."

08:31.160 --> 08:34.770
Hey, now's not the time for notes!

08:34.770 --> 08:37.600
Robin abandoned us!

08:37.600 --> 08:40.240
You're just overreacting, Chocolat-chan.

08:40.240 --> 08:43.170
He was just covering up that we came
from the Magical World for us.

08:44.440 --> 08:49.010
Vanilla-chama, you really should
stop hanging around this ruffian.

08:50.080 --> 08:55.180
But Robin-sensei can really
pick up hearts in an instant.

08:55.620 --> 08:57.420
Oh no, they're about to start the shoot!

08:57.420 --> 08:58.160
Hurry!

08:58.660 --> 09:01.350
Oh, I've seen those boys on television.

09:01.790 --> 09:04.850
Hey, weren't they those two on the poster?

09:05.130 --> 09:10.270
Alright! Let's see if I can use Robin's
techniques on those two!

09:10.940 --> 09:12.300
Chocolat-chan!

09:15.510 --> 09:17.070
Now's your chance, Vanilla.

09:17.070 --> 09:20.480
Huh? Aren't you going to try, Chocolat-chan?

09:20.480 --> 09:23.510
Vanilla, you're the one who took.notes
on Robin's techniques, right?

09:23.510 --> 09:25.380
Do you have something you can use?

09:25.750 --> 09:29.540
Um... um... "The gap is important."

09:29.990 --> 09:34.560
That's it! Try and do something that
you'd never, ever do, Vanilla!

09:34.560 --> 09:35.790
Go!

09:39.460 --> 09:41.500
Something I'd never do...

09:42.330 --> 09:43.770
I'd never do...

09:44.400 --> 09:46.840
I don't know!

09:49.140 --> 09:51.610
What's the matter? Why are you crying?

09:52.180 --> 09:55.070
That's no different from the usual.

09:57.220 --> 09:58.070
I'll...

10:00.080 --> 10:01.420
...whup your butt.

10:01.420 --> 10:02.120
Huh?

10:02.790 --> 10:06.110
So... I shall whup your butt!

10:10.700 --> 10:13.340
Saying "I'll whup your butt"
with a face like that...

10:14.700 --> 10:17.030
I guess I'm no good...

10:17.500 --> 10:20.370
You're a little weird
but I think you're cute.

10:21.970 --> 10:23.640
Alright, now, Vanilla!

10:23.640 --> 10:25.240
Collect that heart!

10:25.980 --> 10:27.710
Sugar Sugar Rune!

10:27.710 --> 10:28.850
Vani Rune!

10:30.450 --> 10:32.570
Heart, heart, please come to me!

10:41.860 --> 10:44.130
Huh? What was I...

10:44.130 --> 10:47.290
Um, I'm sorry! Goodbye.

10:47.530 --> 10:50.270
Chocolat-chan, I took it! An orange heart.

10:53.000 --> 10:56.170
But only because I did what Robin-sensei did.

10:56.640 --> 10:58.800
Okay! I'm going to try it, too!

10:59.540 --> 11:03.310
Hey, why are you all spaced
out? It's your turn.

11:03.310 --> 11:04.760
Yeah...

11:06.380 --> 11:08.220
I'd like to say something.

11:09.190 --> 11:09.850
What?

11:10.190 --> 11:12.860
Your gaze excites me.

11:13.290 --> 11:16.030
I feel like I've met you before.

11:17.300 --> 11:18.780
What the heck?

11:20.260 --> 11:24.440
So, we might have been
lovers in a past life!

11:25.000 --> 11:26.290
Past life?

11:26.500 --> 11:28.800
Are you. .. like, slow or something?!

11:30.010 --> 11:31.300
Chocolat-chan...

11:31.680 --> 11:33.340
And then I blow him a kiss...

11:35.480 --> 11:37.880
I'm kinda busy, so... Bye!

11:38.090 --> 11:39.420
Wait, I've got more...

11:39.880 --> 11:41.510
Ah, that didn't work at all!

11:43.220 --> 11:45.620
What are you going to do
if you scare them off?

11:45.620 --> 11:48.520
That's no different from the usual Chocolat.

11:48.930 --> 11:52.020
It's impossible for me, I can't do it.

11:52.020 --> 11:54.370
Then... what about changing your appearance?

11:54.800 --> 11:56.730
Then you'll have a gap, it'll be perfect!

11:58.600 --> 11:59.640
What do you mean?

12:11.950 --> 12:13.650
Sugar Sugar Rune!

12:13.650 --> 12:14.750
Vani Rune!

12:21.690 --> 12:24.840
All right! Chocolat-chan, you're so cute!

12:26.960 --> 12:30.100
Really? This doesn't
really seem to fit me...

12:31.100 --> 12:32.670
Ewww...

12:32.670 --> 12:34.170
Wanna say that again?

12:34.970 --> 12:37.580
Your inside is just as violent as ever!

12:40.780 --> 12:43.080
Okay, Chocolat-chan, good luck.

12:43.080 --> 12:43.750
Yeah.

12:50.660 --> 12:52.580
How cute...

12:57.560 --> 12:59.160
Good for you, Chocolat-chan!

12:59.160 --> 13:02.630
Alright, just a little more and I'll
change that orange to a pink!

13:03.030 --> 13:05.040
But that's so greedy...

13:05.040 --> 13:07.390
She just swings for the fence.

13:07.840 --> 13:08.240
Hey, you're cute.

13:08.240 --> 13:09.310
Hey, you're cute.

13:09.310 --> 13:12.280
Would you like to, sorta, get some
ice cream from the cafeteria?

13:13.640 --> 13:14.850
W-What?

13:16.270 --> 13:17.900
If you get all mushy on
me, I'll whup your butt!

13:19.720 --> 13:21.950
Wahh! Mommy!

13:22.650 --> 13:25.190
Huh? But I acted just like Vanilla did.

13:26.090 --> 13:27.490
She's an idiot.

13:27.490 --> 13:28.870
In that case...

13:28.870 --> 13:30.360
Sugar Sugar Rune!

13:30.360 --> 13:31.530
Choco Rune!

13:36.500 --> 13:38.370
Huh? That look...

13:38.960 --> 13:41.870
It'll go quicker if I just become Robin.

13:41.870 --> 13:43.610
You think?

13:43.610 --> 13:46.140
Somehow... I don't think
this is the right way.

13:49.280 --> 13:52.880
Your gaze gets me excited.

13:55.190 --> 13:58.690
I feel like I've met you before.

14:00.090 --> 14:05.330
So, we might have been lovers in a past life!

14:06.200 --> 14:07.630
Yay!

14:15.610 --> 14:17.870
This is strange! What's wrong?

14:18.440 --> 14:22.650
If you haven't realized what you're doing
wrong at this point, it's hopeless.

14:22.650 --> 14:23.410
Pierre...

14:35.690 --> 14:38.810
Oh, he has the same name,
but he's a different guy.

14:39.760 --> 14:41.820
But he looks similar.

14:42.270 --> 14:47.820
That's it! Before taking the real Pierre's
heart, I'll practice with this Pierre!

14:52.580 --> 14:55.580
Um... Err...

14:59.320 --> 15:03.790
I know he's not the real Pierre,
but I'm still kind of nervous.

15:04.160 --> 15:06.260
Chocolat-chan, stay strong!

15:07.120 --> 15:13.600
Um... I have a feeling this isn't
the first time I've met... you.

15:17.200 --> 15:19.600
Maybe we were...

15:22.510 --> 15:25.080
She's not acting like
the usual Chocolat-chan!

15:25.640 --> 15:27.360
Maybe she can really do it.

15:34.120 --> 15:36.840
Lovers in a past life.

15:39.560 --> 15:40.460
I said it!

15:41.690 --> 15:44.290
This time it's looking good, Chocolat-chan!

15:53.000 --> 15:55.410
I understand not the Japanese.

15:55.840 --> 15:57.010
I'll whup your butt!

15:57.010 --> 15:58.840
Oh! "wupyourbat?"

16:00.850 --> 16:02.250
Chocolat-chan...

16:03.750 --> 16:07.890
I can't take any hearts acting like Robin!

16:07.890 --> 16:09.280
Of course not!

16:10.290 --> 16:11.780
Robin-sensei.

16:12.720 --> 16:16.780
My methods aren't
so easily copied, you see.

16:17.160 --> 16:20.040
Hmph, you abandoned us earlier.

16:20.430 --> 16:22.070
Still angry about that?

16:22.430 --> 16:26.130
During work, I don't have time to concern
myself with you two, Mademoiselles.

16:26.470 --> 16:28.970
But you have time to get hearts!

16:30.370 --> 16:31.840
That's another issue.

16:32.740 --> 16:34.110
Catch them!

16:34.750 --> 16:36.810
Do it!

16:41.220 --> 16:44.690
No matter what, I'll free you
from your life of captivity!

16:50.290 --> 16:51.320
Duke!

16:51.860 --> 16:56.080
Chocolat, I have decided to elope
with this bullfrog, Ms. Bully!

16:56.730 --> 16:58.530
See ya!

16:58.970 --> 17:01.120
Man. In that case...

17:04.640 --> 17:06.340
Sugar Sugar Rune!

17:06.340 --> 17:07.510
Choco Rune!

17:12.480 --> 17:13.340
Wand!

17:22.130 --> 17:22.990
Alright!

17:25.560 --> 17:26.960
Sugar Sugar Rune!

17:26.960 --> 17:28.030
Choco Rune!

17:39.310 --> 17:39.540
Okay, I caught them.

17:39.540 --> 17:41.660
Okay, I caught them.

17:41.660 --> 17:43.110
But, Chocolat-chan...

17:44.480 --> 17:46.280
Shouldn't you stop the magic by now...

17:47.820 --> 17:50.090
How can I do that?

17:50.850 --> 17:52.720
When did you prepare this?

17:52.720 --> 17:54.060
I don't know.

17:55.290 --> 17:57.660
Chocolat-chan, help me!

17:57.660 --> 18:00.930
Dammit, of course Chocolat wouldn't
know how to stop it!

18:05.040 --> 18:05.770
Chocolat!

18:18.220 --> 18:19.950
Are you okay, Chocolat?

18:20.750 --> 18:22.160
Yeah.

18:22.620 --> 18:25.160
Don't use magic that recklessly.

18:26.260 --> 18:30.210
I think this is the first time I've
seen Robin's serious face.

18:31.330 --> 18:32.630
Robin-san, are you injured?

18:33.330 --> 18:35.590
No problem! I'm fine.

18:36.200 --> 18:38.670
What in the world happened?

18:39.770 --> 18:43.140
Now there's no way
we can continue filming...

18:43.140 --> 18:46.880
And my beautiful
amazon bullfrog ran away!

18:46.880 --> 18:49.390
And what were you planning
to use that for, anyway?

18:49.390 --> 18:51.680
Hey! You guys again?

18:51.680 --> 18:53.280
I'm sorry.

18:53.280 --> 18:55.360
Hey, they're good.

18:55.790 --> 18:59.490
They've just become my friends.

19:01.390 --> 19:03.740
I'm sorry, Robin. It was my fault.

19:05.330 --> 19:07.750
It's rare for you to apologize, Chocolat.

19:08.830 --> 19:11.960
Just leave this to me, Rockin' Robin!

19:12.740 --> 19:14.750
Chocolat, Vanilla, will you lend me a hand?

19:15.040 --> 19:15.770
Sure.

19:16.740 --> 19:17.960
But what should we do?

19:18.740 --> 19:21.970
If it's chocolate they want, then
how about your special spell?

19:27.180 --> 19:28.850
Sugar Sugar Rune!

19:28.850 --> 19:30.020
Choco Rune!

19:37.730 --> 19:39.000
Chocolat Fête!

19:39.000 --> 19:40.330
Come on down!

19:45.700 --> 19:48.130
Wow! It's the Chocolate Party spell!

19:51.980 --> 19:56.110
This is incredible. You,
when did you prepare this?

19:58.080 --> 20:01.550
Rockin' Robin, dancing in
a rain of chocolate...

20:01.550 --> 20:02.710
That'll work!

20:03.420 --> 20:05.720
Cool, it looks like you can do the filming!

20:06.960 --> 20:07.890
What's the matter?

20:08.730 --> 20:10.460
But something is still missing...

20:11.100 --> 20:11.490
Huh?

20:14.670 --> 20:16.190
Mambo!

20:16.670 --> 20:18.940
Barabiri! Milk and Dark!

20:18.940 --> 20:21.210
Bararari! Mint and nuts and raisons!

20:21.210 --> 20:23.480
Welcome to the Chocolate Party!

20:23.480 --> 20:24.340
Yeah...

20:24.340 --> 20:25.210
Yeah!

20:25.610 --> 20:28.450
This is an image of Rockin' Robin
I've never seen before.

20:28.450 --> 20:29.780
This is it!

20:29.780 --> 20:31.210
You think?

20:34.150 --> 20:37.290
Hey, that girl's kinda cute!

20:37.290 --> 20:38.210
Yeah!

20:38.520 --> 20:39.820
Huh? No way!

20:41.090 --> 20:44.060
Agrandissement! Sugar Sugar Rune!

20:44.060 --> 20:45.200
Choco Rune!

20:46.470 --> 20:49.970
Your hearts, pick up!

21:00.580 --> 21:01.750
Alright!

21:03.880 --> 21:05.660
Aw, looky here...

21:05.660 --> 21:09.050
I got hurt right before the filming.

21:09.050 --> 21:11.120
Poor Robin-sama...

21:11.590 --> 21:15.160
If you don't help treat
it, it might not heal...

21:15.890 --> 21:16.930
Right, right?

21:17.860 --> 21:21.600
Um... "Depending on others is important."

21:21.970 --> 21:24.600
Vanilla, you don't need
to take any more notes.

21:25.570 --> 21:26.180
But...

21:26.800 --> 21:29.540
We were stupid trying to act like Robin.

21:30.010 --> 21:33.680
We'll show him we can get a ton of
hearts using our own methods!

21:35.650 --> 21:36.690
That's right.

21:37.850 --> 21:40.950
Robin, you really did protect us.

21:45.690 --> 21:47.950
Robin, you really are amazing!

21:48.490 --> 21:50.590
Chocolat, save me!

21:50.590 --> 21:53.960
Duke! It's your fault we got into that mess!

21:54.260 --> 21:56.300
Sh-She tried to eat me...

21:56.970 --> 21:59.970
Ms. Bully tried to eat me!

22:00.900 --> 22:04.960
She was just staring at me
because she was hungry!

22:05.440 --> 22:07.480
Aw, Duke got dumped.

22:08.380 --> 22:09.970
I found the bullfrog!

22:23.080 --> 22:29.390
I light a red candle, and whisper:

22:29.520 --> 22:30.890
"Love"

22:31.830 --> 22:35.330
A magic spell.

22:37.500 --> 22:44.770
With you, there's nothing to be afraid of... probably.

22:46.200 --> 22:54.280
Please hold me. Where am I going?

22:55.950 --> 23:00.220
Take me along, take me along,

23:00.820 --> 23:03.890
To the world beyond the moon.

23:04.190 --> 23:11.260
It doesn't matter if everyone stops.

23:12.630 --> 23:16.070
To the world beyond the moon.

23:18.070 --> 23:26.180
I'll be waiting in the real world.

23:26.240 --> 23:35.090
The eternal world of which you spoke.

23:47.010 --> 23:49.790
Lately, Vanilla's been acting strangely.

23:50.160 --> 23:51.990
She won't make me dinner...

23:52.280 --> 23:54.210
She won't make me dinner...

23:54.210 --> 23:57.290
And... SHE WON'T MAKE ME DINNER!

23:58.210 --> 24:00.540
I'm so hungry, Vanilla...

24:01.390 --> 24:04.840
Huh? She has a friend more important than me?

24:05.490 --> 24:07.290
Next time on Sugar Sugar Rune:

24:07.770 --> 24:10.270
More important than love!? The magic of friendship.

24:10.800 --> 24:12.830
If you don't watch it, I'll whup your butt!

24:12.830 --> 24:13.820
Thanks!
